{"id":"re_sidence","lemma":"résidence","pos":"noun","rank":2832,"glosses":["residence (place where one resides)"],"ipa":"/ʁe.zi.dɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/41/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-r%C3%A9sidence.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-r%C3%A9sidence.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"résidences"},"formAudio":{"résidences":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-r%C3%A9sidences.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est notre résidence.","en":"That's our house.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"our"},null]},{"text":"Il vit dans une résidence fermée.","en":"He lives in a gated community.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"closed","l":"fermé"}]},{"text":"Nous n'avons pu trouver son lieu de résidence.","en":"We couldn't find out her whereabouts.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to find"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Nous vivons tous dans la même résidence étudiante.","en":"All of us live in the same dorm.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivre"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"same"},null,{"g":"studying","l":"étudiant"}]},{"text":"Tenez-nous informés si vous changez de lieu de résidence.","en":"Let us know if you change your residence.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tenir"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"informed","l":"informé"},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to exchange","l":"changer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}